# Game balance

## Accuracy & hit chance

- Units should start at **100% accuracy** by default.
- Without other factors (distance, cover, status, etc.), attacks are **deterministic** (always hit).
- Miss chance comes only from situational modifiers (and ability-specific falloff), not from a base accuracy deficit.
- Attack `attack_range` and distance falloff (`distance_penalty_per_tile`) live on the attack ability, not the unit.
- Range and movement use Chebyshev (diagonals) by default — see `grid.mdc`.

